0x0041 Number of Sensors (UINT); 5 read 0x0042 Number of Alarms (UINT); 6 read 0x0043 Number of
Ports (UINT); 7 read 0x0044 Number of Faults (UINT); 8 read 0x0045 Software Version (32 ASCII);
9 read 0x0065 System Name (32 ASCII); 10 read 0x0085 HW Mac Address (3 words Hex).
