(32); 0x0041 HW MAC (3); 0x0044 stack-member bitmap; 0x0045 ports; 0x0046 faults; 0x0047
sensors; 0x0048 global alarms; 0x0049 per-member alarms; per member (unit id): 0x0120–0x0124
boards/ports/faults/sensors/alarms, 0x0200 board class, 0x0201 slot, 0x0202 Board Name (32),
0x0222 Serial Number (32), 0x0242 board MAC (3).

