FAIL — 22650-fail.log. 9/10 steps equal the CLI at their Mapping-Version-5 addresses; Number
of Alarms (0x0049) over-reports by exactly one member's 31 alarms on a stack with a provisioned
member 2. Also: the AWPTCM case text carries the version-1 register addresses.
